Protocol research and reference implementations
-----------------------------------------------

This project is an independent reimplementation of the Huawei "lite wearable"
BLE protocol. It was written from the following AGPL-3.0 licensed sources:

* Gadgetbridge — https://codeberg.org/Freeyourgadget/Gadgetbridge
  Copyright (C) Gadgetbridge contributors.
  Relevant files: devices/huawei/HuaweiPacket.java, HuaweiTLV.java,
  HuaweiCrypto.java, packets/FileUpload.java, packets/MusicControl.java,
  service/devices/huawei/HuaweiUploadManager.java, HuaweiMusicManager.java and
  the request classes under service/devices/huawei/requests/.

* HuaSideload — https://github.com/Burak4Arslan/huawei-watch-sideload-ios
  Copyright (C) Burak Arslan and contributors.
  A Swift port of the Gadgetbridge Huawei code with on-device verification
  (HuaweiProtocol.swift, HuaweiAuth.swift, HuaweiFeatures.swift,
  HuaweiSession.swift).

No Huawei proprietary code, firmware, keys or other assets are included.
